Z||000002||Predator||01-16-2001||10:08 PM||||Well if it has been sitting uncranked for 14 years it would make a very heavy paper weight. That would be about the most I would think it would be good for. Everything on it would be rotted. You would have to rebuild from the ground up. 5,000 miles or not would not matter in this case, and the transmission is probably locked up as well. Just my .02 worth. To me it's not worth the cost it would take to ship it. The guy should be trying to give it away not sell it. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero4_1.jpg"> ||||reg||6
